### Review references a place that does not exist (404)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "authorName": "test",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "test"
}


